                <mxCell id="Ohu_rihZBkmFTRXGpnVS-45" value="&lt;h1&gt;Req. Notes&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Make adding a 'salary' optional&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;-- ability to provide a monthly or weekly pay, along with a pay date &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;--- post-tax input only, don't want to be responsible for tax calculations, that can be messy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- need a calendar-type view that starts on 'payday' and ends the day before the next payday, showing where the budgetted items fit in &lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#2D7600;fillColor=#60a917;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
