                <mxCell id="Ohu_rihZBkmFTRXGpnVS-61" value="&lt;h1&gt;Req. Notes&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;-? Is it worth being able to categorise budget-items?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;-- Benefit to being able to generalise the graphics/viduals/charts involved, i.e. 'oh I spent X amount on clothes this month'&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;---worth adding later? How much extra work is it&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#2D7600;fillColor=#60a917;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" vertex="1">
